feat(shortcuts): implement .lnk COM interop, drag-and-drop and faithful execution

Implement Stage E5 (Shortcuts .lnk, drag & drop and execution integrity):
- Encapsulate COM IShellLinkW/IPersistFile and PNG icon extraction in ShellLinkReader (StickyDock.Interop) with guaranteed DestroyIcon and COM release in finally blocks.
