- Enforce strict .lnk-only external drag & drop (Q-01, HU04 CA #2) and internal reordering via ShortcutDragDropBehavior without code-behind logic.
- Add context menu actions (move to bar/ribbon, remove) without target/argument editing (Q-06), v3->v4 schema migration (AddBarItemsMigration), and connect BarItemCount.
- Update docs/plan/ESTADO.md to close E5 (442/442 tests passing, Release/Debug clean).

